preact-htm.mjs is htm 3.1.1's `preact/standalone.module.js`
(https://github.com/developit/htm), which bundles Preact 10
(https://github.com/preactjs/preact) with htm and Preact's hooks into one
ES module, fetched from unpkg unmodified.

  htm      — Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2018 Google Inc.
  Preact   — MIT License, Copyright (c) 2015-present Jason Miller

The full texts are at the projects above. The page vendors the file so it
loads offline from the service worker's cache and never from a CDN.
